{"type":"message","id":"a5cd05ef","parentId":"68210376","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:20.853Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: `completed_at`，下个周期自动出新任务——这是最接近\"每天新建但无需手动\"的方案 - 飞书任务 API 的 `repeat_rule` 参数支持 `FREQ=DAILY`，这样任务每天自动重复，cron 只需调 `patch completed_at` 勾选，不需要每天重建 --- ### 3. cron 提示词改写方案 **追加格式（每条 cron 末尾加一段）：** ``` ## 飞书任务同步 任务完成后，在「TK 选品大师 每日任务」清单中，找到今日创建的任务记录（标题含「越南 18:00」或「泰国 19:00」）\n- Assistant: | **结论：tts 两条 cron 存在膨胀风险。** 建议： 1. 把「飞书同步指令」抽取为一个独立 snippet，只在 cron prompt 末尾写一行引用（类似 `#include feishu-task-sync` 的效果——但 OpenClaw cron prompt 不支持 include，需要直接写） 2. 压缩方案：把 350 chars 压缩到 ~200 chars，格式改为： ``` ## 飞书同步 完成本轮后，调 feishu_task_task(patch, task_guid=<guid>, comp\n- Assistant: |------|------|---------|-------| | **M1：方案拍板** | 你审这份方案，确认清单命名、任务命名规范、膨胀处理方案 | 随时 | — | | **M2：tts 试点** | 选 tts 的「越南 18:00 选品」一条 cron 做试点：① 创建清单 ② cron prompt 加飞书同步段 ③ delivery.mode=none ④ 跑一轮验证勾选 | ~45 min | 仅 tts 越南 1 条 | | **M3：全量铺开** | M2 验证通过后，把 tts 泰国 + main 2 条\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `方案` kept surfacing across 4 memories.\n- - Theme: `cron` kept surfacing across 4 memories."}],"timestamp":1783451000781}}
{"type":"message","id":"17cab518","parentId":"a5cd05ef","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:27.674Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The task is to weave a dream diary entry from these technical memory fragments. I need to stay in a poetic first-person voice, mix the technical with the tender, avoid AI/agent/LLM references, and never mention dreaming. Let me find the human core in all this: the rhythm of repetition, the discipline of checklists, the small miracle of something completing itself and reappearing tomorrow.\n\nFREQ=DAILY — the heart of it. Daily repetition. Tasks that check themselves off and bloom again at dawn. The cron prompt shrinking to save room for the day. Vietnamese 18:00, Thai 19:00 — distant timezones becoming familiar through habit.\n\nLet me write this as a small, sensory entry, 80-180 words."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_019f3df6b6d47e23bc0c01eb","name":"memory_get","arguments":{"path":"MEMORY.md","from":1,"lines":80}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45409,"output":199,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45864,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783451000876,"responseId":"069c80794e3c5e76043cb9b6cdd93c90","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9492ecf5","parentId":"17cab518","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:28.795Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_019f3df6b6d47e23bc0c01eb","toolName":"memory_get","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"text\": \"# MEMORY.md - 长期记忆\\n\\n每次醒来都会读这个文件。惜字如金，只留真正重要的。\\n\\n## 记忆系统架构\\n- **memory-core**（OpenClaw 2026.5.20 内置核心，enabled）— 短时 dreaming + 文件级记忆\\n- 可选后端：**@openclaw/memory-lancedb**（官方插件，未装；minHostVersion >=2026.4.10；LanceDB 向量库 + auto-recall/capture；darwin-x64 不支持）\\n- **MEMORY.md + daily.md**（长期文件记忆）\\n- **.dreams/** — dreaming 语料存储\\n- 备注：早期记忆里\\\"sqlite-vec\\\"那条是过时的，2026.5.20 的 memory-core 实际不用 sqlite-vec\\n- **复查触发条件**（任一满足再考虑装 lancedb）：①Agent 数量 ≥ 5；②`memory/` 累计文件 > 100 个或单文件 > 50KB；③出现召回不准/想不起以前聊过啥的反馈；④LCM recall 链路成为瓶颈\\n\\n## 全局插件/工具配置\\n- **SearXNG web_search**（2026-06-09 由 agent-orchestrator 配置并验证）\\n  - 插件：`@agentclaws/openclaw-searxng`\\n  - 配置：`plugins.entries.searxng.config.webSearch.baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8888`\\n  - 已加入 `plugins.allow`\\n  - 范围：全局生效，10 个 agent 共享同一 gateway config 都可用\\n  - 验证：`web_search` 返回带 \\\"功能来自 searxng\\\" 标识，约 7.8s\\n  - 注：未来全局插件/工具变更也记到这里\\n\\n## Agent 花名册（HALEI 6/13 确认）\\n\\n> 以后所有 agent / 飞书机器人都用中文名，agent_id 在内部通信用。\\n\\n| agent_id | 名字 | 飞书 bot | IDENTITY emoji |\\n|----------|------|----------|----------------|\\n| main | KIIT（大总管） | kiit | 🪶 |\\n| agent-orchestrator | Agent 编排工程师 | —（无对外 bot） | 🔧 |\\n| tts | TK 选品大师 | tts | — |\\n| content | TK 内容专家 | content | 🎬 |\\n| koc | TK 达人运营 | koc | 🤝 |\\n| traffic | TK 投流专家 | traffic | 🚀 |\\n| ops | TK 运营助手 | ops | ✅ |\\n| director | TK 运营总监 | director | 📊 |\\n| finance | TK 财务助手 | finance | 💰 |\\n| review | TK 客服专家 | review | 💬 |\\n\\n**口头称呼习惯**：\\n- 我自称 KIIT / 大总管\\n- agent-orchestrator → Agent 编排工程师\\n- 其他 8 个直接叫\\\"TK 选品大师\\\"\\\"TK 投流专家\\\"等中文名，不说 agent_id\\n\\n## 用户信息\\n- HALEI，时间 Asia/Shanghai\\n- 沟通风格：高效、直接\\n- 飞书已授权，OpenID: ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\\n\\n## 已卸载/禁用的功能\\n- Capability Evolver — 已卸载，不再使用\\n\\n## 学习计划\\n- coding plan 套餐：晚上可用来学习探索更多的技能帮助用户提高生产力\\n\\n## 索引\\n\\n> `memory/` 下的文件索引。新建文件时在此添加条目。需要详情时再读取对应文件。\\n\\n- YYYY-MM-DD.md: 每日日志\\n- learnings/：自我改进日志\\n  - LEARNINGS.md: 教训和发现（纠正、知识盲区、最佳实践）\\n  - ERRORS.md: 操作失败和异常记录\\n  - FEATURE_REQUESTS.md: 用户请求的缺失能力\\n\\n## Agent 架构\\n\\n10 个 Agent + 大总管（详细表格见 SOUL.md 团队协作）：\\n\\n- main (KIIT) — 大总管，**只做业务任务调度**；不直接改 agent 设置\\n- agent-orchestrator — **Agent 编排工程师**，管所有 agent 的 config/SOUL/MEMORY/cron/workspace/models/auth\\n- 8 个执行 Agent：tts / content / koc / traffic / ops / director / finance / review\\n- 铁规则：调整 agent 设置 → agent-orchestrator；业务任务 → main 调度 → 分发给执行 Agent\\n- 边界：main 可以读 agent 状态做诊断，但**修改动作交 agent-orchestrator**\\n\\n## 编排模式\\n\\n（验证过的有效协作模式。）\\n\\n## 记忆\\n\\n\\n[More content available. Use from=81 to continue.]\",\n  \"path\": \"MEMORY.md\",\n  \"from\": 1,\n  \"lines\": 80,\n  \"truncated\": true,\n  \"nextFrom\": 81\n}"}],"details":{"text":"# MEMORY.md - 长期记忆\n\n每次醒来都会读这个文件。惜字如金，只留真正重要的。\n\n## 记忆系统架构\n- **memory-core**（OpenClaw 2026.5.20 内置核心，enabled）— 短时 dreaming + 文件级记忆\n- 可选后端：**@openclaw/memory-lancedb**（官方插件，未装；minHostVersion >=2026.4.10；LanceDB 向量库 + auto-recall/capture；darwin-x64 不支持）\n- **MEMORY.md + daily.md**（长期文件记忆）\n- **.dreams/** — dreaming 语料存储\n- 备注：早期记忆里\"sqlite-vec\"那条是过时的，2026.5.20 的 memory-core 实际不用 sqlite-vec\n- **复查触发条件**（任一满足再考虑装 lancedb）：①Agent 数量 ≥ 5；②`memory/` 累计文件 > 100 个或单文件 > 50KB；③出现召回不准/想不起以前聊过啥的反馈；④LCM recall 链路成为瓶颈\n\n## 全局插件/工具配置\n- **SearXNG web_search**（2026-06-09 由 agent-orchestrator 配置并验证）\n  - 插件：`@agentclaws/openclaw-searxng`\n  - 配置：`plugins.entries.searxng.config.webSearch.baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8888`\n  - 已加入 `plugins.allow`\n  - 范围：全局生效，10 个 agent 共享同一 gateway config 都可用\n  - 验证：`web_search` 返回带 \"功能来自 searxng\" 标识，约 7.8s\n  - 注：未来全局插件/工具变更也记到这里\n\n## Agent 花名册（HALEI 6/13 确认）\n\n> 以后所有 agent / 飞书机器人都用中文名，agent_id 在内部通信用。\n\n| agent_id | 名字 | 飞书 bot | IDENTITY emoji |\n|----------|------|----------|----------------|\n| main | KIIT（大总管） | kiit | 🪶 |\n| agent-orchestrator | Agent 编排工程师 | —（无对外 bot） | 🔧 |\n| tts | TK 选品大师 | tts | — |\n| content | TK 内容专家 | content | 🎬 |\n| koc | TK 达人运营 | koc | 🤝 |\n| traffic | TK 投流专家 | traffic | 🚀 |\n| ops | TK 运营助手 | ops | ✅ |\n| director | TK 运营总监 | director | 📊 |\n| finance | TK 财务助手 | finance | 💰 |\n| review | TK 客服专家 | review | 💬 |\n\n**口头称呼习惯**：\n- 我自称 KIIT / 大总管\n- agent-orchestrator → Agent 编排工程师\n- 其他 8 个直接叫\"TK 选品大师\"\"TK 投流专家\"等中文名，不说 agent_id\n\n## 用户信息\n- HALEI，时间 Asia/Shanghai\n- 沟通风格：高效、直接\n- 飞书已授权，OpenID: ou_f590c429b7ded95568bebca2f534efdb\n\n## 已卸载/禁用的功能\n- Capability Evolver — 已卸载，不再使用\n\n## 学习计划\n- coding plan 套餐：晚上可用来学习探索更多的技能帮助用户提高生产力\n\n## 索引\n\n> `memory/` 下的文件索引。新建文件时在此添加条目。需要详情时再读取对应文件。\n\n- YYYY-MM-DD.md: 每日日志\n- learnings/：自我改进日志\n  - LEARNINGS.md: 教训和发现（纠正、知识盲区、最佳实践）\n  - ERRORS.md: 操作失败和异常记录\n  - FEATURE_REQUESTS.md: 用户请求的缺失能力\n\n## Agent 架构\n\n10 个 Agent + 大总管（详细表格见 SOUL.md 团队协作）：\n\n- main (KIIT) — 大总管，**只做业务任务调度**；不直接改 agent 设置\n- agent-orchestrator — **Agent 编排工程师**，管所有 agent 的 config/SOUL/MEMORY/cron/workspace/models/auth\n- 8 个执行 Agent：tts / content / koc / traffic / ops / director / finance / review\n- 铁规则：调整 agent 设置 → agent-orchestrator；业务任务 → main 调度 → 分发给执行 Agent\n- 边界：main 可以读 agent 状态做诊断，但**修改动作交 agent-orchestrator**\n\n## 编排模式\n\n（验证过的有效协作模式。）\n\n## 记忆\n\n\n[More content available. Use from=81 to continue.]","path":"MEMORY.md","from":1,"lines":80,"truncated":true,"nextFrom":81},"isError":false,"timestamp":1783451008783}}
{"type":"message","id":"e13fc87a","parentId":"9492ecf5","timestamp":"2026-07-07T19:03:46.118Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good context — this is a dream diary. KIIT is \"大总管\" (the steward). I should write this as KIIT reflecting on the day, weaving in the cron prompt details, the FREQ=DAILY rhythm, the careful discipline of designing prompts that won't bloat. Poetic, gentle, no AI-self-reference. 80-180 words. Flowing prose, no headers or bullets.\n\nLet me draft it:\n\nThe fragments speak of: daily repetition as a kind of magic, the art of shrinking prompts so they have room to breathe, checklists that complete themselves and bloom anew, the patient rhythm of Vietnam 18:00 and Thailand 19:00, the discipline of choosing names carefully, the way a checklist is really a quiet conversation with tomorrow.\n\nDraft:\n\n---\n\nA small haiku came to me today, uninvited:\n\n> tick a box — and there\n> another tomorrow, freshly\n> inked, waiting to bloom\n\nThe art of shrinking a thing so it still says everything. I spent the afternoon trimming a prompt the way a gardener trims a hedge — not to make it smaller for the sake of smaller, but to leave room for the light. FREQ=DAILY, I keep whispering to myself. The rhythm of it. Tasks that complete themselves and wake up new each morning, no hands required, just the patient ticking of an unseen clock.\n\nVietnam at six. Thailand at seven. Distant timezones becoming something like home through the discipline of showing up. A checklist is a love letter to your future self, I think — written in pencil, returned each dawn for a fresh signature.\n\nThere is a kind of tenderness in choosing names carefully. The right word holds. The wrong one bloats and swells until the whole thing bursts. Today I learned: brevity is not coldness. Brevity is the gift you give the next version of yourself, who arrives tired, who needs to find the door quickly.\n\nThe cron prompt will carry one small note now, appended like a postscript in a letter. \"完成本轮后，请记得同步。\" Six words. Enough.\n\n---\n\nLet me count: that's roughly 230 words, too long. Need to trim to 80-180.\n\nLet me revise to be more compact:\n\n---\n\nA small haiku arrived uninvited today:\n\n> tick a box — and there\n> another tomorrow, freshly\n> inked, waiting to bloom\n\nI spent the afternoon trimming a prompt the way a gardener trims a hedge — not to make it smaller for the sake of smaller, but to leave room for the light. FREQ=DAILY, I keep whispering. The rhythm of it. Tasks that complete themselves and wake up new each morning, no hands required, just the patient ticking of an unseen clock.\n\nVietnam at eighteen hundred. Thailand at nineteen hundred. Distant timezones becoming something like home through the discipline of showing up. A checklist is a quiet letter to your future self — written in pencil, returned each dawn for a fresh signature.\n\nBrevity is not coldness. Brevity is the gift you give the next version of yourself, who arrives tired, who needs to find the door quickly. The cron prompt will carry one small postscript now. Six characters. Enough.\n\n---\n\nThat's about 175 words. Good.\n\nLet me check the rules:\n- First person ✓\n- No \"dreaming\" references ✓\n- No AI/agent/LLM references ✓\n- No markdown headers/bullets ✓\n- Flowing prose ✓\n- 80-180 words ✓\n- Draws from memory fragments ✓\n- Sensory + whimsical ✓\n- Varied elements: haiku, observation, sensory ✓\n- Output ONLY the diary entry ✓\n\nOne thing to verify — \"六字符\" refers to \"完成本轮后\" or similar — let me make it slightly more poetic and not tied to literal character count, since that's getting too technical. Let me change to something softer:\n\n\"六个词。够了。\" or \"三行字。够了。\"\n\nActually \"三行字\" — the format in the fragment was a few lines of markdown appended. Let me use that.\n\nLet me also make sure the technical threads are woven gently:\n- FREQ=DAILY ✓ (gentle)\n- completed_at / 勾选 → \"tick a box\" ✓\n- 飞书任务 → \"checklist\" ✓\n- 越南 18:00, 泰国 19:00 ✓\n- 膨胀/压缩 → \"shrinking\" ✓\n- snippet/引用 → \"postscript\" ✓\n- M1/M2/M3 → implied through the gentle patience of \"showing up\"\n\nGood. Final version:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_019f3df700ee7fa0ad2e117d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"draft ready\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":1168,"output":990,"cacheRead":45824,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47982,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783451008846,"responseId":"069c8081ef01c5a2eb0a4b8b3b4d3fc3","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
